<p>קבועים ב־<code>server/app/clock.py</code>: <code>DAY_WITNESS_END = 2</code>, <code>DAY_DELIBERATION_START = 2</code>, <code>DAY_DELIBERATION_END = 5</code>, <code>DAY_VERDICT = 6</code>, <code>DAY_CLOSED = 7</code>. ה־worker מוצא תיקים לפי <code>idx_cases_due (status, phase_deadline_at)</code>.</p>
